        </span>
       </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-[#545454]/80">
       Somatic Experiencing is a body-oriented approach to stress, trauma, overwhelm, boundaries, and nervous-system regulation. Ryan integrates nervous-system awareness into his broader bodywork practice.
      </p>
     </details>
     <details class="group py-6">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none text-2xl text-[#545454] marker:hidden">
       <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6">
        Where is Ryan’s Rolfing located?
        <span class="text-[#c4924a] transition group-open:rotate-45">
         +
        </span>
       </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-[#545454]/80">
       Ryan’s Rolfing is located at 101 Parkshore Drive in Folsom, California, serving clients from Folsom, El Dorado Hills, Shingle Springs, Cameron Park, Placerville, El Dorado County, and Sacramento.
      </p>
     </details>
     <details class="group py-6">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none text-2xl text-[#545454] marker:hidden">
       <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6">
        Are you accepting new clients?
        <span class="text-[#c4924a] transition group-open:rotate-45">
         +
        </span>
       </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-[#545454]/80">
       Yes. You can book online through Square, or email Ryan if you are unsure which session type is the best fit.
      </p>
     </details>
    </div>
   </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#545454] px-5 py-20 text-white">
   <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
    <h2 class="text-5xl text-white md:text-6xl">
     Ready to begin?
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-9 text-white/75">
     Book a Rolfing session online or reach out with questions.
    </p>
    <a class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#c4924a] px-8 py-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white hover:bg-[#9b7139]" href={bookingUrl('faq')}>
